# Never weaken a guard

The guard files are listed in [CODEOWNERS](../../.github/CODEOWNERS). Before changing one, find the threats it
covers in the [security model](../../docs/architecture/security-model.md), and in the PR state why each is
still stopped and which test proves it. Never relax a guard to make a test or a workflow easier; never add a
bypass flag, a global MCP registration, or a fail-open path.
